notes: OBJ5 delivered. Redaction covers TR-059's five sinks with a seeded
       positive for each — the five differ in what scanning even means (files
       as bytes, log output as what a formatter emits, the exception payload as
       a rendered traceback), so one seeded case would have evidenced one sink
       and left four asserted by analogy.
       CredentialHandle closes every rendering path: __repr__, __str__,
       __format__, __reduce__, and __slots__ so there is no __dict__ to walk.
       configuration_failure_message refuses a detail argument for the
       credential key rather than redacting one — a parameter that does not
       exist cannot be forgotten.
       The self-referential test trap recurred for the fourth and fifth time
       this phase: a check scanning source text matches the prose explaining
       what it looks for. Every such check in this epic is now an AST walk.
       The lesson generalises and is recorded in the plan as OI-15: a check
       whose subject is code must read the parse tree, because prose about code
       contains the words the code is being checked for.
       Environment, unchanged and worth repeating: the DB container has been
       torn down externally five times, twice with its volume. Re-run
       `docker compose up -d db` then `uv run --directory src/model migrate`.
